#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:396
msgid "%d name(s) every %ds"
msgstr "每 %d 秒 %d 个名称"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:198
msgid ""
"%d of %d observed responses were not used. That is normal: the observer sees "
"every answer on the network, and only the ones for a domain you routed are "
"of any interest."
msgstr ""
"未使用 %d 个观测到的响应，共 %d 个观测到的响应。这是正常的：观测程序看到网络"
"上的每个回应，但只对你路由的域的回应感兴趣。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:86
msgid "%d pkt matched"
msgstr "匹配了 %d 个数据包"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:28
msgid "%dh %dm"
msgstr "%d 小时 %d 分钟"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:32
msgid "%dm %ds"
msgstr "%d 分钟 %d 秒"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:34
msgid "%ds"
msgstr "%d 秒"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:243
#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:116
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:96
msgid "Add policy"
msgstr "添加策略"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:135
msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:495
msgid ""
"Addresses that answer ICMP echo, reachable through every policy interface - "
"public resolvers are the usual choice. Every interface a route policy uses "
"is probed through itself every 5 seconds; one that answers no target for "
"three rounds is treated as down and its policies fall back until it answers "
"again. Empty means no tracking, see the README."
msgstr ""
"可通过每个策略接口抵达的响应 ICMP echo 消息的地址——公共解析器是通常的选择。一"
"条路由策略使用的每个接口每 5 秒钟通过其自身被探测；一个接口如果三轮探测均未响"
"应则被视为 down，其策略将后撤，直到该接口再次回应。空白表示无追踪，详见 "
"README。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:130
msgid "Answer carried no usable address"
msgstr "应答没有携带可用地址"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:193
msgid "Answers used for a policy"
msgstr "用于策略的应答"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:56
#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:42
msgid "Apply failed: %s"
msgstr "应用失败：%s"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:148
msgid "Block the traffic (killswitch)"
msgstr "拦截流量（Killswitch）"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:120
msgid "Bypass - leave the traffic alone"
msgstr "旁路——不改动流量"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:138
msgid "Bytes routed"
msgstr "已路由的字节数"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:469
msgid ""
"Ceiling in seconds for a learned address in its Set. An address learned from "
"a DNS answer expires with the TTL of that answer, clamped to the range 60 to "
"this value; a polled address uses this value. Keep it well above the poll "
"interval."
msgstr ""
"其集合中学到的地址的最长秒数。从 DNS 应答学到的地址随该应答的 TTL 而过期，固"
"定到这个值的 60 区间；轮询地址使用这个值。保持该值远高于轮询间隔。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:167
msgid "Client MACs this policy applies to, ORed with the addresses above."
msgstr "这条策略应用到的客户端 MAC，和上方的地址之间关系为 OR。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:179
msgid "Client Selectors"
msgstr "客户端选择器"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:162
msgid ""
"Client addresses or prefixes this policy applies to. Leave empty to apply to "
"every client."
msgstr "此策略应用到哪些客户端地址或前缀。留空应用到每个客户端。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:138
msgid "Compression pointer in the question"
msgstr "涉及到的指针压缩"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:448
msgid "DNS Observer Settings"
msgstr "DNS 观测程序设置"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:188
msgid "DNS responses observed on %s since the service started"
msgstr "服务器启动以来在 %s 上观察到的 DNS 响应"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:455
msgid "Debug Logging"
msgstr "调试记录"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:194
msgid "Destination Address Files"
msgstr "目标地址文件"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:189
msgid "Destination Addresses"
msgstr "目标地址"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:184
msgid "Destination Ports"
msgstr "目标端口"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:190
msgid "Destination addresses or prefixes to route into this policy."
msgstr "要路由进该策略的目标地址或前缀。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:206
msgid "Domain Files"
msgstr "域名文件"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:128
msgid "Domain is in no policy"
msgstr "域名不在策略中"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:201
msgid "Domains"
msgstr "域名"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:452
msgid "Enable the shunt service."
msgstr "启用 shunt 服务。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:451
#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:111
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:132
msgid "Error reply, e.g. NXDOMAIN"
msgstr "错误回复，如 NXDOMAIN"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:89
msgid ""
"Evaluated top to bottom - the first policy a packet matches wins. Within one "
"policy the selectors are ANDed: source plus domain means only that client, "
"and only to those domains."
msgstr ""
"从上到下评估——数据包匹配的第一条策略胜出。一条策略中选择器之间的关系为 AND："
"源加域只表示那个客户端，并且只针对那些域。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:172
msgid ""
"Everything arriving on these devices, ORed with the client selectors above - "
"a whole guest network or VLAN, in IPv4 and IPv6 alike, whatever prefix it "
"gets. Not the router's own traffic. For domains, add the device to the "
"observed devices as well."
msgstr ""
"到达这些设备上的一切，和上方客户端选择器之间关系为 OR——整个访客网络或 VLAN，"
"IPv4 和 IPv6 都一样，不论获取的前缀是什么。不是路由器自己的流量。对于域名，也"
"把设备添加到观测到的设备中。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:53
msgid "Expecting a bare file name or an absolute path, without whitespace"
msgstr "期待裸文件名或绝对路径，没有空白"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:136
msgid "Expires"
msgstr "过期"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:150
msgid "Extension header chain too long"
msgstr "扩展头链太长"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:147
msgid "Fall through to the normal uplink"
msgstr ""

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:249
msgid "Fallback"
msgstr "备选"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:144
msgid "Fallback Behavior"
msgstr "备选行为"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:195
msgid ""
"Files with one address or prefix per line, IPv4 and IPv6 mixed, for large "
"published ranges. A bare name lives under /tmp/shunt, an absolute path is "
"used as given. After the file changed, refresh below."
msgstr ""
"每行一个地址或前缀（IPv4 和 IPv6 混搭）的文件，用于大量已发布地址段。裸名称位"
"于 /tmp/shunt 目录下，绝对路径按给定的使用。文件更改后，在下方刷新。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:207
msgid ""
"Files with one domain pattern per line, for large or community-maintained "
"lists. A bare name lives under /tmp/shunt, an absolute path is used as "
"given. Entries from a file are learned by the DNS observer only, never "
"polled; after the file changed, refresh below."
msgstr ""
"每行一个域名模式的文件，用于大型列表或社区维护的列表。裸名称位于 /tmp/shunt "
"目录下，绝对路径按给定的使用。来自文件的条目只被 DNS 观测程序学习，永远不会被"
"轮询；文件更改后，在下方刷新。"

