msgid "Policy"
msgstr "策略"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:316
msgid ""
"Policy based routing by mac, source, destination and domain. For further "
"information please check the %s."
msgstr "根据 mac、来源、目的地和域名的基于策略的路由。进一步信息请查看 %s。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:422
msgid "Poll"
msgstr "轮询"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:463
msgid "Poll Interval"
msgstr "轮询间隔"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:494
msgid "Probe Targets"
msgstr "探测目标"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-shunt.json:47
msgid "Processing Log"
msgstr "正在处理日志"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:178
msgid "Protocols"
msgstr "协议"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:137
msgid "Proxy Port"
msgstr "代理端口"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:484
msgid ""
"Read DNS answers as they pass the LAN device, whichever resolver produced "
"them. Required for wildcard domains, which cannot be resolved ahead of time."
msgstr ""
"在 DNS 应答通过 LAN 设备时读取它们，不管这些应答由哪个解析器所产生。对于通配"
"符域名是必需的，这类域名无法提前解析。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:142
msgid "Record length does not fit the type"
msgstr "记录长度和类型不符"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:250
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:242
msgid "Refresh List Files"
msgstr "刷新列表文件"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:68
msgid "Refresh failed: %s"
msgstr "刷新失败：%s"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:290
msgid "Rejected settings"
msgstr "被拒绝的设置"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:139
msgid "Reserved label type"
msgstr "保留的标签类型"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:179
msgid "Restrict to tcp, udp or both. A port without a protocol covers both."
msgstr "仅限 tcp、udp 或两者。没有协议的端口覆盖 tcp 和 udp。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:381
msgid "Reverse path filtering is strict"
msgstr "反向路径筛选为 strict"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:119
msgid "Route into a policy interface"
msgstr "路由进策略接口"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:117
msgid ""
"Route the selected traffic into the interface below, bypass it - a bypass "
"policy marks nothing and exempts the traffic from every policy after it - or "
"hand it to a transparent proxy on the router."
msgstr ""
"将所选的流量路由到下方接口中，绕过它——旁路策略什么也不标记并让流量豁免每一条"
"在它后面的策略——或者将它交给该路由器上的一个透明代理。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:248
msgid "Routes"
msgstr "路由"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:247
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:517
#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:234
msgid "Save & Restart"
msgstr "保存并重启"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:464
msgid "Seconds between poll cycles."
msgstr "轮询周期间隔（秒）。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:414
msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:233
#: applications/luci-app-shunt/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-shunt.json:39
msgid "Set Reporting"
msgstr "集合报告"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:460
msgid ""
"Set rp_filter to 2 on shunt's own policy interfaces, at start and when one "
"comes up."
msgstr "在启动时和 shunt 自己的策略接口即将出现时将该接口上的 rp_filter 设为 2。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:444
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:477
msgid ""
"Should be at least twice the poll interval (%d), otherwise entries expire "
"between cycles."
msgstr "应至少是轮询间隔（%d）的两倍，不然条目在两个周期间过期。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:185
msgid ""
"Single ports or ranges like 8000-8080, ANDed with the addresses below. Ports "
"alone select that traffic from every client."
msgstr ""
"单一端口或像 8000-8080 这样的区间，与下方的地址是 AND 关系。如果只有端口则选"
"中来自每个客户端的流量。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:161
msgid "Source Addresses"
msgstr "源地址"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:171
msgid "Source Devices"
msgstr "源设备"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:166
msgid "Source MAC Addresses"
msgstr "源 MAC 地址"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:181
msgid "Static Destinations"
msgstr "静态目的地"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:510
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:383
msgid ""
"Strict rp_filter will drop shunt's marked traffic on %s. Set rp_filter to 2 "
"on the policy interface, enable rp_filter_manage to have shunt do it, or "
"loosen it box-wide; see the README."
msgstr ""
"严格的 rp_filter 会丢弃 shunt 在 %s 上的标记流量。在策略接口上设置 rp_filter "
"为 2，启用 rp_filter_manage 让 shunt 执行它，或者将它放宽到 box-wide；详见 "
"README。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:246
msgid "Table"
msgstr "路由表"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:489
msgid ""
"The LAN device the DNS answers cross on their way to the clients, normally "
"br-lan. One entry per network segment, see the README."
msgstr ""
"DNS 应答的 LAN 设备，通常为 br-lan，在它们前往客户端的路上交叉。每个网络段一"
"个条目，见 README。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:126
msgid ""
"The device or logical interface this policy routes into. A netifd name is "
"resolved to its device; any other device name is used as entered."
msgstr ""
"这条策略路由进的设备或逻辑接口。netifd 名称解析到其设备；任何其他设备名用作 "
"entered。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:138
msgid ""
"The port the transparent proxy listens on, for tcp and udp. It must listen "
"on loopback or on the wildcard address. Needs kmod-nft-tproxy."
msgstr ""
"对于 tcp 和 udp 协议，透明代理监听的端口。它必须监听回环或通配符地址。需要 "
"kmod-nft-tproxy。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/logtemplate.js:44
msgid "The syslog output, pre-filtered for messages related to: %s"
msgstr "syslog 输出，已预过滤获取和下列内容相关的消息：%s"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:292
msgid ""
"These entries were skipped. Everything else was applied - a rejected entry "
"never takes the service down."
msgstr "这些条目被跳过。应用了所有其他条目——被拒绝的条目永远不会让服务下线。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:143
msgid "Too many answers"
msgstr "回应太多"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:147
msgid "Too many stacked VLAN tags"
msgstr "过多的堆叠 VLAN 标签"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:154
msgid ""
"Traffic to networks the routing table already has a route for - your other "
"subnets, your static routes - stays on the normal path instead of entering "
"the policy interface. Turn this off only for a hermetic killswitch."
msgstr ""
"前往路由表已经有路由的网络的流量——你的其他子网，你的静态路由——待在正常路径上"
"而不是进入策略接口。仅为密闭的 killswitch 关闭此选项。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:121
msgid "Transparent proxy on the router"
msgstr "路由器上的透明代理"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:134
msgid "Truncated response"
msgstr "截断的响应"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:416
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:145
msgid ""
"What new traffic does when the interface is down or, for a transparent "
"proxy, when nothing listens on its port."
msgstr "接口故障时或透明代理没有端口监听时，新流量做什么。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:236
msgid ""
"What the nftables Sets currently hold. Counters are reset whenever an entry "
"is refreshed, so they show recent activity, not a lifetime total."
msgstr ""
"nftables 集合目前有什么。每当一个条目刷新时，计数器将重置，这样显示的是近期活"
"动，不是生存时间总数目。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:421
msgid "across all policies"
msgstr "所有策略"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/setreport.js:193
msgid "all policies"
msgstr "所有策略"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:216
msgid "answers the health probes"
msgstr "回应健康度探测"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/policies.js:202
msgid ""
"example.com matches that name only, *.example.com matches its subdomains but "
"not the apex - list both to cover both."
msgstr ""
"example.com 只匹配 example.com。*.example.com 匹配其子域名但不匹配 "
"example.com，要涵盖子域名和 example.com 需要两个都列出。"

